C (hand-written CSS) is actually most practical given the limited set of classes used\n- **Phase 4**: CSS variable approach is sound, but the number of hardcoded colors in `export.html` needs to be catalogued\n- **Phase 5**: Model pattern matches codebase conventions\n\nNow let me write the refined plan."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":135,"cache_read_input_tokens":87486,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":135},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3839cf6e-a734-4f22-9b6c-baf7b95a120f","uuid":"0a37f7bb-7096-4783-ae97-593d0a7ef87e"}
