/task\r","-- Include in `collectSelectedFeatures()` → rename to `collectExportSelection()`\r","-\r","-### 2g. Tests\r","-\r","-**File:** `vista/tests/test_export_service.py`\r","-**Action:** MODIFY\r","-\r","-| # | Test | Description |\r","-|---|------|-------------|\r","-| 1 | `test_get_exportable_ralph_jobs_finds_jobs` | Jobs with plans are discovered |\r","-| 2 | `test_get_exportable_ralph_jobs_excludes_empty` | Jobs with only job.json are excluded |\r","-| 3 | `test_read_ralph_artifact_path_traversal` | Path traversal is blocked |\r","-| 4 | `test_generate_html_with_ralph_jobs` | HTML includes Ralph job sections |\r","-| 5 | `test_export_ralph_jobs_endpoint` | GET endpoint returns correct shape |\r","-\r","----\r","-\r","-## Phase 3: Offline-First (Inline CDN Dependencies)\r","-\r","-**Priority: MEDIUM** — Important for sharing exported files where recipients may not have internet.\r","-\r","-### 3a. Download and vendor CDN dependencies\r","-\r","-**New directory:** `vista/server/views/static/vendor/`\r","-\r","-Download minified versions:\r","-- `tailwind.min.css` — Use Tailwind standalone CLI to generate a CSS file with only the classes used in `export.html`. This replaces the CDN JIT compiler with a pre-built CSS file (~30-50KB gzipped).\r","-- `mermaid.min.js` — Download from jsdelivr CDN (~1.5MB minified). This is the largest dependency.\r","-- `marked.min.js` — Download from jsdelivr CDN (~40KB minified).\r","-\r","-**Alternative approach (recommended):** Instead of vendoring files to disk, **fetch and inline at export time**:\r","-\r","-### 3b. Add an `InlineDependencyService`\r","-\r","-**File:** `vista/server/services/inline_deps_service.py` (NEW)\r","-\r","-```python\r","-class InlineDependencyService:\r","-    \"\"\"Manages offline-ready dependency bundling for HTML exports.\"\"\"\r","-\r","-    VENDOR_DIR = config.STATIC_DIR / \"vendor\"\r","-\r","-    # Pre-downloaded minified files\r","-    DEPS = {\r","-        \"tailwind_css\": VENDOR_DIR / \"tailwind-export.min.css\",\r","-        \"mermaid_js\": VENDOR_DIR / \"mermaid.min.js\",\r","-        \"marked_js\": VENDOR_DIR / \"marked.min.js\",\r","-    }\r","-\r","-    @classmethod\r","-    def get_inline_deps(cls) -> dict[str, str]:\r","-        \"\"\"Return dependency contents for inlining into export HTML.\r","-\r","-        Returns dict with keys: tailwind_css, mermaid_js, marked_js.\r","-        Each value is the file content as a string.\r","-        Falls back to CDN URLs if vendor files are missing.\r","-        \"\"\"\r","-```\r","-\r","-**Tailwind approach:** Use Tailwind's Play CDN for dev/preview but generate a static CSS file for exports:\r","-1. Extract all Tailwind utility classes used in `export.html` (they're static — the template uses a fixed set)\r","-2. Pre-generate a Tailwind CSS file containing only those classes\r","-3. Store as `vendor/tailwind-export.min.css` (~15-25KB for the specific classes used)\r","-4. Alternative: Use a pre-compiled Tailwind CSS build that includes all used classes\r","-\r","-### 3c. Add offline mode toggle to export API\r","-\r","-**File:** `vista/server/routes/export.py`\r","-**Action:** MODIFY `ExportRequest`\r","-\r","-```python\r","-class ExportRequest(BaseModel):\r","-    features: list[ExportFeatureSelection]\r","-    ralph_jobs: list[ExportRalphJobSelection] = []\r","-    offline: bool = False  # NEW: when True, inline all dependencies\r","-```\r","-\r","-### 3d. Modify template to support both CDN and inline modes\r","-\r","-**File:** `vista/server/views/export.html`\r","-**Action:** MODIFY\r","-\r","-Use Jinja2 conditionals:\r","-```html\r","-{% if inline_deps %}\r","-    <style>{{ inline_deps.tailwind_css }}</style>\r","-    <script>{{ inline_deps.mermaid_js }}</script>\r","-    <script>{{ inline_deps.marked_js }}</script>\r","-{% else %}\r","-    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\r","-    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mermaid@11/dist/mermaid.min.js\"></script>\r","-    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/marked@15/marked.min.js\"></script>\r","-{% endif %}\r","-```\r","-\r","-**Important:** When inlining, Tailwind CDN script must be replaced with a pre-compiled `<style>` tag since the JIT compiler won't work inline. The `tailwind_css` content must be a CSS file, not the Tailwind JS.\r","-\r","-### 3e. Update `generate_export_html()` to pass inline deps\r","-\r","-**File:** `vista/server/services/export_service.py`\r","-**Action:** MODIFY\r","-\r","-```python\r","-def generate_export_html(\r","-    ...,\r","-    offline: bool = False,  # NEW\r","-) -> str:\r","-    inline_deps = None\r","-    if offline:\r","-        inline_deps = InlineDependencyService.get_inline_deps()\r","-\r","-    return template.render(\r","-        ...,\r","-        inline_deps=inline_deps,\r","-    )\r","-```\r","-\r","-### 3f. Add offline toggle to export modal\r","-\r","-**File:** `vista/server/views/project.html`\r","-**Action:** MODIFY\r","-\r","-Add a checkbox in the modal footer:\r","-```html\r","-<label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer\">\r","-    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"export-offline\" class=\"rounded\">\r","-    <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">Offline mode (larger file, no CDN needed)</span>\r","-</label>\r","-```\r","-\r","-Include in `startExport()`:\r","-```javascript\r","-body: JSON.stringify({\r","-    features: selected,\r","-    offline: document.getElementById('export-offline').checked,\r","-}),\r","-```\r","-\r","-### 3g. Generate vendor files (one-time setup task)\r","-\r","-**Action:** Create a script or document the process for downloading/generating vendor files.\r","-\r","-For Tailwind CSS specifically:\r","-- Option A: Use `npx tailwindcss` CLI to scan `export.html` and generate minimal CSS\r","-- Option B: Use a pre-built Tailwind CSS with all utility classes (~300KB)\r","-- Option C: Replace Tailwind utilities in export.html with hand-written CSS (~5KB) — most reliable but most work\r","-\r","-**Re